Purpose: Require senior approval for high-priority items
PBI_05

Prerequisite: Create a custom field
First, you need to create the "SeniorApproved" field:

Go to Process → Work Item Types → Product Backlog Item

Go to Fields tab

Click Add field

Fill:

Field Name: SeniorApproved


Type: Identity (to select users)

Required: Optional

Click Save

Now Configure the Rule:
Name	"6a_Senior Approval for Priority 1-Commited"

Condition: A work item state changes to ... → Committed
Actions (Then)
✅	Make required ...
✅	Field SeniorApproved
Click Save

Name	"6b_Senior Approval for Priority 1 - Active"
Conditions (When)
Condition: A work item state changes to ... →  Active
✅	Make required ...
✅	Field SeniorApproved
Click Save

Name	"6c_Senior Approval for Priority 1 - Inprogress"
Conditions (When)
Condition: A work item state changes to ... →  Inprogress
✅	Make required ...
✅	Field SeniorApproved
Click Save

